ine", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118838168/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 140, "playtime_forever": 147, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 147, "last_played": 1619454686, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would recommend it but you are at the mercy of EA... you've been warned...", "timestamp_created": 1712370553, "timestamp_updated": 1712370553, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "162217256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057433861", "personaname": "Bimbo", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Arkyitaa/", "num_games_owned": 292, "num_reviews": 79, "playtime_forever": 2266, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1907, "last_played": 1769089276, "avatar": "12c61f92a32081eef04a24a07f91b22a13458d1e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ HATE EA", "timestamp_created": 1712267385, "timestamp_updated": 1712267385, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 28, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.593528866767883301", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "162028920", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996475619", "personaname": "JimboYCS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jimboycs/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 85, "playtime_forever": 1039, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1039, "last_played": 1711657260, "avatar": "1b1a5c670c7d290028917f805848acb42f71399b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Only reviewing the MP:\n\nThe game is very much active, the longest queue I had it was like maybe 20 seconds, it's exactly as I remember it: a lot of fun (played the Alpha or Beta version for MP). But the thing is... EA. Apparently every since they forced players to use their 3rd Party Software (Origin, wahtever it's called now), the game performance is just random. For first week I was playing, I had no issues, maybe the game wasn't that much smooth, but it was fine for me... and out of sudden in next week the game just started randomly stutters in random moments and 10 seconds later is just fine. The weirdest part, those stutters  doesn't appears while you spectate team mates when you died for whatever reason (like idk, joining in middle of round and spawns you next to enemies). \n\nMan, I honestly want to enjoy it, but when game is just randomly ♥♥♥♥ it self during combat, give me break. EA like per usual proves it, that they are dumpster on fire garbage. Another good game in to the bin, because of company's ego.", "timestamp_created": 1712066820, "timestamp_updated": 1712066820, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497635066509246826", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}